1
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,300
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:27,700
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,580
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:35,300
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:38,980
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:42,660
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:48,340
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:55,400
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:58,010
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,010 --> 00:00:59,500
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,100
=Episode 9=

12
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:15,380
Yuya, you're here.

13
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:17,540
You came to see me so early.

14
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,340
Is something important going on?

15
00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:21,060
Qingyun,

16
00:01:22,020 --> 00:01:23,260
stop what you're doing.

17
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:29,740
What do you mean by that, Yuya?

18
00:01:30,060 --> 00:01:31,820
Your deal with Xingzhao Pavilion.

19
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:34,500
I already know everything about it.

20
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:37,220
What are you talking about?

21
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:39,140
I don't understand.

22
00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:42,300
The Xingzhao Pavilion assassins
have all confessed.

23
00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:45,340
Are you still going to cling to this?

24
00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:53,300
You and I grew up together.

25
00:01:53,540 --> 00:01:54,980
The late Emperor granted us a marriage.

26
00:01:55,540 --> 00:01:57,140
If she hadn't injured my leg,

27
00:01:57,580 --> 00:01:59,220
I should have been the one to marry you.

28
00:01:59,380 --> 00:02:00,780
I know you feel wronged.

29
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:03,380
In the end, it's all my fault.

30
00:02:03,820 --> 00:02:05,660
I gave you false hope

31
00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:06,980
and let you keep making mistakes.

32
00:02:07,340 --> 00:02:08,860
If you have a problem, come at me alone.

33
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:11,620
Leave Feng Weiyue out of this.

34
00:02:13,900 --> 00:02:16,740
You used to loathe Feng Weiyue.

35
00:02:17,660 --> 00:02:20,700
How come in less than a month,

36
00:02:22,540 --> 00:02:23,940
you've fallen in love with her?

37
00:02:28,740 --> 00:02:30,740
For the sake of our childhood bond,

38
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:33,620
as long as you stop,

39
00:02:34,380 --> 00:02:37,540
I can pretend
none of this ever happened.

40
00:02:37,900 --> 00:02:39,060
But if

41
00:02:39,780 --> 00:02:42,180
anything ever happens
to Feng Weiyue again,

42
00:02:42,860 --> 00:02:45,700
I will personally send you to hell.

43
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:02,100
Yuya, why?

44
00:03:02,740 --> 00:03:04,220
Why?

45
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:09,040
(Book)

46
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:14,220
(Xingzhao Pavilion's attempt
on Weiyue was ordered by Feng Qingyun.)

47
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:16,180
(Then the one who wants me dead...)

48
00:03:16,540 --> 00:03:18,180
(Who is really behind it?)

49
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:22,020
Your Highness, we found out

50
00:03:22,460 --> 00:03:23,860
that the employer behind yesterday's
Xingzhao Pavilion assassination

51
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:25,660
was the Grand Princess.

52
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:27,300
Mo Xuanji?

53
00:03:38,100 --> 00:03:40,740
(The Grand Princess.)

54
00:03:41,860 --> 00:03:45,020
(Has my dear sister finally decided
to move against me?)

55
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:49,580
(Gentle Breeze, Serene Ease)

56
00:03:52,540 --> 00:03:54,860
I've already talked to Feng Qingyun.

57
00:03:54,980 --> 00:03:56,380
I believe in a few days

58
00:03:56,980 --> 00:03:59,300
she'll withdraw the kill order.

59
00:04:13,460 --> 00:04:14,820
I wasn't peeking at you.

60
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:34,180
This is clearly Gu Nanke's bracelet.
Why is it on your wrist?

61
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:35,980
I bought it myself.

62
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:37,820
You're insane.

63
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:40,540
Still not telling the truth?

64
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:43,820
There are plenty of identical bracelets.

65
00:04:43,820 --> 00:04:45,260
I bought this myself.

66
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:47,580
Let go!

67
00:04:47,580 --> 00:04:48,820
You're hurting me.

68
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:03,300
Feng Weiyue, who gave you permission
to mess with me?

69
00:05:10,420 --> 00:05:11,380
Mo Yuya!

70
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:12,380
Yuya.

71
00:05:18,100 --> 00:05:20,260
Go on, you two. Continue.

72
00:05:32,940 --> 00:05:34,740
You scum, Mo Yuya! Scumbag!

73
00:05:44,860 --> 00:05:46,060
It's over?

74
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:51,060
Fine.

75
00:05:51,420 --> 00:05:52,180
I just

76
00:05:52,340 --> 00:05:53,940
want a grandchild too much.

77
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:57,260
Mother, you visit so late.

78
00:05:57,940 --> 00:05:58,940
Is there something urgent?

79
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:01,860
At tomorrow night's
Mid-Autumn palace banquet,

80
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:04,740
take Weiyue with you.

81
00:06:06,060 --> 00:06:07,060
It seems

82
00:06:07,100 --> 00:06:09,580
you two are getting closer and closer.

83
00:06:09,820 --> 00:06:11,900
Now I can rest easy.

84
00:06:12,660 --> 00:06:13,340
Mother.

85
00:06:14,380 --> 00:06:15,260
Tell me,

86
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:18,100
can a person really change so completely

87
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:20,180
all of a sudden?

88
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:24,340
The old her clung to me relentlessly

89
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:26,340
and was utterly unremarkable.

90
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:27,740
But now...

91
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:29,380
Now...

92
00:06:29,740 --> 00:06:30,820
Now,

93
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:32,900
you've fallen for her.

94
00:06:37,780 --> 00:06:38,620
Mother.

95
00:06:41,180 --> 00:06:43,460
Could she not be the real Feng Weiyue?

96
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:47,060
Why do you say that?

97
00:06:48,180 --> 00:06:49,340
Pavilion Master,

98
00:06:49,460 --> 00:06:50,540
you don't recognize me?

99
00:06:51,060 --> 00:06:52,060
Pavilion Master?

100
00:06:53,180 --> 00:06:55,260
Today I found Gu Nanke's bracelet

101
00:06:55,940 --> 00:06:57,060
on Weiyue's wrist.

102
00:07:00,140 --> 00:07:01,340
Perhaps

103
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:03,380
it's just a similar item.

104
00:07:04,140 --> 00:07:06,020
I've met all kinds of people in my life.

105
00:07:06,420 --> 00:07:08,780
That girl has innocent eyes.

106
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:11,140
She's not the kind of person
you're worried about.

107
00:07:12,300 --> 00:07:13,220
Perhaps

108
00:07:15,300 --> 00:07:16,340
I really was overthinking.

109
00:07:16,340 --> 00:07:17,660
You were overthinking.

110
00:07:18,140 --> 00:07:19,060
Besides,

111
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:22,380
even if there really is
something suspicious,

112
00:07:22,660 --> 00:07:23,700
you've already kissed her

113
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:24,780
and held her.

114
00:07:25,940 --> 00:07:28,700
You've fallen for her long ago, boy.

115
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:31,780
Well,

116
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:33,620
there's no turning back now.

117
00:07:34,900 --> 00:07:37,740
(Prince Rong's Mansion)

118
00:07:43,860 --> 00:07:45,420
Well? Do I look good?

119
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:49,740
Am I really wearing this
to the Mid-Autumn banquet?

120
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:50,900
It's a palace banquet, after all.

121
00:07:51,220 --> 00:07:52,260
We should be more formal.

122
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:53,340
All right.

123
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:57,980
You absolutely can't lose your mind
like last night again.

124
00:07:58,780 --> 00:07:59,900
If you do,

125
00:08:00,180 --> 00:08:01,180
I'll turn against you,

126
00:08:01,380 --> 00:08:02,260
and I won't cure your poison.

127
00:08:02,340 --> 00:08:05,100
Last night, Mother talked with me
for a long time

128
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:06,500
and scolded me.

129
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:08,940
It really was my fault.

130
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:11,980
I won't be suspicious of you again.

131
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:14,540
That's more like it.

132
00:08:14,580 --> 00:08:16,100
You do learn.

133
00:08:46,460 --> 00:08:47,340
My dear,

134
00:08:48,700 --> 00:08:50,180
you look beautiful.

135
00:08:57,060 --> 00:09:01,260
(Imperial Palace;
Mountain Winds, Silent Woods)

136
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:07,700
(Emperor)

137
00:09:13,580 --> 00:09:14,780
Weiyue.

138
00:09:31,140 --> 00:09:32,660
(Feng Weiyue...)

139
00:09:43,660 --> 00:09:45,420
Bravo!

140
00:09:48,180 --> 00:09:51,500
Miss Feng Qingyun, you truly live up
to your reputation on the guqin.

141
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:56,100
Your Majesty, you flatter me.

142
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:57,420
My guqin playing

143
00:09:57,460 --> 00:10:00,380
is actually nowhere near even
a fraction of my sister's dancing.

144
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:03,220
I...

145
00:10:03,540 --> 00:10:06,220
(Why does Feng Qingyun spout nonsense
right off the bat?)

146
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:08,100
(Since when can I dance?)

147
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:10,540
Since Qingyun puts it that way,

148
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:13,540
why not ask the princess consort
to dance for us

149
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:15,460
and let us see for ourselves?

150
00:10:16,820 --> 00:10:20,020
- I didn't know she could dance.
- (So Feng Qingyun was planning this.)

151
00:10:20,300 --> 00:10:21,100
Oh my.

152
00:10:21,100 --> 00:10:22,540
Truly multi-talented.

153
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:24,620
(Mo Yuya...)

154
00:10:24,620 --> 00:10:25,340
Looking forward to it.

155
00:10:25,340 --> 00:10:28,340
(Don't think that because the Emperor
is young and relies on your regency,)

156
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:32,180
(you can control him
and command the lords.)

157
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:33,660
What's wrong?

158
00:10:34,260 --> 00:10:36,220
We invited you so warmly,

159
00:10:36,500 --> 00:10:38,260
yet you show no response,
Princess Consort?

160
00:10:39,100 --> 00:10:40,740
Could it be you think

161
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:43,140
we're not as noble as the prince

162
00:10:43,140 --> 00:10:44,940
and unworthy of seeing you dance?

163
00:10:45,500 --> 00:10:47,300
(Looks like
Feng Qingyun's trick isn't enough.)

164
00:10:47,700 --> 00:10:49,420
(Now the Grand Princess
is trying to embarrass me, too?)

165
00:10:50,260 --> 00:10:51,980
(Since you and Mo Yuya
don't get along,)

166
00:10:52,860 --> 00:10:53,580
(then...)

167
00:10:55,180 --> 00:10:56,260
Fine, I'll dance.

168
00:11:00,020 --> 00:11:02,020
Feng Weiyue, are you serious?

169
00:11:02,380 --> 00:11:06,100
Feng Qingyun learned dancing
from the Imperial Music Bureau.

170
00:11:07,060 --> 00:11:08,580
In the three years since you married in,

171
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:10,660
you haven't even embroidered
a single dancing robe.

172
00:11:11,260 --> 00:11:12,140
Relax.

173
00:11:12,500 --> 00:11:14,180
I have plenty more surprises.

174
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:16,660
May I ask what music you want, Weiyue?

175
00:11:17,340 --> 00:11:18,740
You can tell the Imperial Music Bureau
musicians.

176
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:19,860
No need.

177
00:11:20,500 --> 00:11:22,300
I brought my own BGM.

178
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:30,740
Your Highness, just watch.

179
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:09,140
Feng Weiyue,

180
00:12:09,620 --> 00:12:11,020
what is that thing?

181
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:13,300
Oh, don't worry about that for now.

182
00:12:13,660 --> 00:12:15,700
I may need you to help me out
with this dance.

183
00:12:18,460 --> 00:12:20,900
She's really pulling the prince
into dancing with her.

184
00:12:22,340 --> 00:12:23,020
That's right.

185
00:12:23,380 --> 00:12:25,380
Tonight, my husband and I

186
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:28,500
will perform a duet dance for everyone.

187
00:12:28,900 --> 00:12:29,940
I hope you all

188
00:12:29,940 --> 00:12:32,180
have fun and enjoy the show.

189
00:12:36,140 --> 00:12:38,100
What are you up to now?

190
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:40,580
I don't know how to dance
this duet you're talking about.

191
00:12:41,460 --> 00:12:43,660
This is an emergency. Help me out here.

192
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:46,580
It's very simple. I believe in you.
Come on.

193
00:12:56,690 --> 00:12:57,300
Come on.

194
00:13:02,340 --> 00:13:04,820
(Mo Yuya, don't be nervous.)

195
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:06,780
(Just follow my rhythm.)

196
00:13:07,220 --> 00:13:10,140
(When I move forward, you move back.)

197
00:13:10,860 --> 00:13:13,460
(When I move back, you move forward.)

198
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:16,620
(Don't worry. I've got you.)

199
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:21,180
♪Hear the old years surge♪

200
00:13:22,100 --> 00:13:25,380
♪The bright moon shines alone
on the one I knew♪

201
00:13:25,420 --> 00:13:28,460
♪Falling into my arms♪

202
00:13:29,540 --> 00:13:32,180
♪Countless charms between your brows♪

203
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:35,980
♪Yet you leave me battered and scarred♪

204
00:13:36,820 --> 00:13:42,460
♪Still, I call it love♪

205
00:13:44,220 --> 00:13:46,100
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

206
00:13:46,140 --> 00:13:50,460
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

207
00:13:51,020 --> 00:13:53,420
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

208
00:13:53,460 --> 00:13:58,060
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

209
00:13:58,340 --> 00:14:01,860
♪My true heart has never changed♪

210
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:05,380
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

211
00:14:06,140 --> 00:14:10,940
♪To meet year after year♪

212
00:14:40,500 --> 00:14:43,380
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

213
00:14:43,580 --> 00:14:45,900
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

214
00:14:47,540 --> 00:14:49,940
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

215
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:52,740
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

216
00:14:53,740 --> 00:14:56,740
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

217
00:14:57,300 --> 00:14:59,540
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

218
00:15:00,660 --> 00:15:05,140
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

219
00:15:08,020 --> 00:15:10,420
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

220
00:15:11,060 --> 00:15:13,740
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

221
00:15:14,900 --> 00:15:17,540
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

222
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:20,100
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

223
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:24,260
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

224
00:15:24,620 --> 00:15:26,980
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

225
00:15:27,660 --> 00:15:28,900
♪This love remains unchanged♪

226
00:15:28,900 --> 00:15:32,420
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

227
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:36,580
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

228
00:15:36,700 --> 00:15:40,700
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

229
00:15:41,060 --> 00:15:43,460
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

230
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:45,400
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

231
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:47,100
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

232
00:15:47,860 --> 00:15:50,460
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

233
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:54,780
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

234
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:57,140
♪I don't regret that vow♪

235
00:15:57,340 --> 00:16:00,620
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
